  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8231784",
      "title": "Highlighting Selected Answers & Managing More State",
      "sourceHash": "bf79e4f27529d7569908e4117c51b89df4f9f74c0524a06dec23dad0220dad82",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 3.84,
          "en": "So now that we got this working timer here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.84,
          "end": 6.09,
          "en": "I'd like to enhance this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.09,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "by making sure that as the user picks an answer here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.83,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "I actually first highlight that answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "And then after a second",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "the color of the answer changes to green",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "if it was the correct answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 23.88,
          "en": "or red if it was the wrong answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.88,
          "end": 27.72,
          "en": "And then after let's say two additional seconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.72,
          "end": 29.973,
          "en": "the next question should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.17,
          "end": 34.14,
          "en": "So instead of instantly switching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.14,
          "end": 37.68,
          "en": "to a different question as an answer is selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.68,
          "end": 41.88,
          "en": "I'd like to lock the answer in and show the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.88,
          "end": 43.71,
          "en": "whether it was right or wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.71,
          "end": 45.33,
          "en": "before moving on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.33,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "That's my idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 49.32,
          "en": "And to implement this idea,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.32,
          "end": 52.143,
          "en": "some changes in the code are required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 54.21,
          "en": "To be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "in the quiz component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 59.58,
          "en": "we'll have to work on this handle select answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.58,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 66.03,
          "en": "because instead of storing the selected answer right away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.03,
          "end": 67.23,
          "en": "which would lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 69.96000000000001,
          "en": "to the next question being selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.96000000000001,
          "end": 74.96000000000001,
          "en": "I first of all wanna change the color of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.182,
          "end": 76.182,
          "en": "the selected answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.55199999999999,
          "end": 80.67,
          "en": "And to do that we could start managing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.67,
          "end": 82.593,
          "en": "a second piece of state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.203,
          "en": "which basically controls our current answer state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "And that could be an empty string initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "for example, or a text like unanswered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 98.94,
          "en": "to make it clear that the question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.94,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "has not been answered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.44,
          "end": 102.43,
          "en": "But I'll go for an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 107.22999999999999,
          "en": "and I'll name this answer state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.72,
          "end": 112.263,
          "en": "and have my set answer state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "And then here in handle select answer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "I wanna change my answer state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 122.34,
          "en": "and change it to answered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.34,
          "end": 124.923,
          "en": "once the user did select an answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 133.28,
          "en": "Then I also want to set a timer in here with set timeout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.65,
          "end": 136.383,
          "en": "so that after a second. let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.312,
          "end": 139.29,
          "en": "so after 1000 milliseconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "we changed that answer state to correct",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 146.04,
          "en": "if the correct answer was chosen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 149.17000000000002,
          "en": "or to wrong if the wrong answer was chosen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.21,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "and later we'll use this state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 154.923,
          "en": "to update the styling of the answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 157.71,
          "en": "So here after one second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.71,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "I wanna find out whether it was the right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 161.97,
          "en": "or wrong answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 163.529,
          "en": "For that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.529,
          "end": 164.362,
          "en": "we can add a if check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.362,
          "end": 167.223,
          "en": "and simply take a look at the answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.223,
          "end": 169.53,
          "en": "that was chosen by the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.53,
          "end": 171.01,
          "en": "so the selected answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.93,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "and simply compare it to the correct answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 178.65,
          "en": "of the question which was presented to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.65,
          "end": 180.69,
          "en": "And there we know that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.69,
          "end": 183.99,
          "en": "when it comes to the answers for all those questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.99,
          "end": 185.97,
          "en": "it's always the first answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.97,
          "end": 188.763,
          "en": "in that raw data that's the correct answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 193.23,
          "en": "So if the selected answer is equal to this first answer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.23,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "we know that the correct answer was chosen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 199.82999999999998,
          "en": "So here we can therefore check if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.82999999999998,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "selected answer is equal to questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.03,
          "end": 206.25,
          "en": "So to my raw questions data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.25,
          "end": 209.23,
          "en": "and there of course the active question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.63,
          "end": 211.95,
          "en": "and then there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 211.95,
          "end": 215.34300000000002,
          "en": "take a look at the first answer in its list of answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.442,
          "end": 218.82,
          "en": "If our selected answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "is equal to that first answer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 223.653,
          "en": "we know it's the right answer that was picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 226.5,
          "en": "So then we can update our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.5,
          "end": 231.5,
          "en": "and set answer state equal to correct like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 236.4,
          "en": "Else, we wanna set the answer state to wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.4,
          "end": 238.923,
          "en": "because then a wrong answer was picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.71,
          "end": 242.97,
          "en": "Now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.97,
          "end": 246.24,
          "en": "I am using the active question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.24,
          "end": 250.23,
          "en": "in this handle select answer function though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 253.32,
          "en": "And since this is wrapped with useCallback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.32,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "we therefore now have to add active question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 260.58,
          "en": "to this dependencies array of useCallback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 260.58,
          "end": 263.37,
          "en": "Because this function here that's wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.37,
          "end": 266.52,
          "en": "by useCallback should be recreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.52,
          "end": 269.91,
          "en": "whenever the act of question index value changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.91,
          "end": 273.87,
          "en": "because we're using that value in that function body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.87,
          "end": 277.89,
          "en": "and we don't want to use an outdated value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 277.89,
          "end": 279.06,
          "en": "So it's important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 279.06,
          "end": 284.06,
          "en": "that it gets recreated whenever this answer index changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 284.82,
          "end": 288.003,
          "en": "Hence it must be added here as a dependency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 290.76,
          "end": 292.279,
          "en": "Now of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.279,
          "end": 293.49,
          "en": "another problem we'll face",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 293.49,
          "end": 296.22,
          "en": "is that the act of question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.22,
          "end": 298.2,
          "en": "will change right away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.2,
          "end": 301.023,
          "en": "once the user answer has been selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 302.25,
          "end": 306.48,
          "en": "Now one workaround could be to move this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.48,
          "end": 310.41,
          "en": "where we update this array of user answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 310.41,
          "end": 312.72,
          "en": "into this timeout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.72,
          "end": 316.68,
          "en": "where we mark an answer as correct or wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 316.68,
          "end": 318.18,
          "en": "But if we would do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.18,
          "end": 319.74,
          "en": "we would still move away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 319.74,
          "end": 322.95,
          "en": "from this question right after we know whether",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 322.95,
          "end": 324.36,
          "en": "it was correct or wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.36,
          "end": 325.89,
          "en": "and we would not be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 325.89,
          "end": 329.31,
          "en": "to update the styling and show the user that it was right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 329.31,
          "end": 331.26,
          "en": "or wrong because, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 331.26,
          "end": 332.793,
          "en": "we moved away right away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 334.02,
          "end": 336,
          "en": "So what I'll do instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336,
          "end": 338.90999999999997,
          "en": "is I'll simply go back here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 338.90999999999997,
          "end": 341.73,
          "en": "and make sure that my active question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 341.73,
          "end": 344.79,
          "en": "is equal to user answers length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 344.79,
          "end": 349.233,
          "en": "if the current answer state is an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 350.1,
          "end": 352.443,
          "en": "So if the question has not been answered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 353.4,
          "end": 355.05,
          "en": "So if this is an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 355.05,
          "end": 358.32,
          "en": "then my current active question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 358.32,
          "end": 361.14,
          "en": "is equal to user answers length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 361.14,
          "end": 365.31,
          "en": "Otherwise it should be equal to user answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 365.31,
          "end": 367.14,
          "en": "length minus one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 367.14,
          "end": 371.703,
          "en": "so that we still stick to the old questions, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 374.34,
          "end": 376.8,
          "en": "And that of course also implies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 376.8,
          "end": 379.77,
          "en": "that we need to reset the answer state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 379.77,
          "end": 381.693,
          "en": "to an empty string at some point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 383.16,
          "end": 385.71,
          "en": "And I wanna reset it in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 385.71,
          "end": 389.373,
          "en": "after we marked the answer as correct or wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 390.3,
          "end": 393.36,
          "en": "Here, I wanna set another timer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 393.36,
          "end": 395.79,
          "en": "So I'm having some nested timers here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 395.79,
          "end": 399.663,
          "en": "which will only start after this timer expired.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 401.67,
          "end": 404.64,
          "en": "This timer could now be set to two seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 404.64,
          "end": 409.02,
          "en": "And here I wanna set my answer state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 409.02,
          "end": 410.85,
          "en": "back to an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 410.85,
          "end": 414.54,
          "en": "which in the end makes sure that the answer gets reset.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 414.54,
          "end": 415.71,
          "en": "So to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 415.71,
          "end": 419.1,
          "en": "it's no longer marked as right or wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 419.1,
          "end": 421.86,
          "en": "And due to the logic we added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 421.86,
          "end": 424.773,
          "en": "we will then also move on to the next question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
